{"seq":3,"slug":"high-availability-scalability","title":"高可用与弹性伸缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/platform-architecture/high-availability-scalability","wordCount":1753,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"高可用与弹性伸缩\">高可用与弹性伸缩</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>高可用（High Availability）是指系统在面对硬件故障、网络中断、流量突增等异常情况时仍能持续提供服务的能力。电商平台的可用性目标通常为 99.99%（四个九），意味着全年不可用时间不超过 52.6 分钟。弹性伸缩（Elasticity）则是系统根据负载变化自动调整计算资源的能力，在大促流量高峰时自动扩容，在低谷期自动缩容以节约成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 多可用区部署&#10;        AZ1[可用区 A]&#10;        AZ2[可用区 B]&#10;        AZ3[可用区 C]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 流量调度&#10;        DNS[DNS 智能解析]&#10;        GLB[全局负载均衡]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 容灾机制&#10;        FAILOVER[自动故障转移]&#10;        BACKUP[数据多副本]&#10;        DEGRADE[降级预案]&#10;    end&#10;    DNS --&gt; GLB&#10;    GLB --&gt; AZ1&#10;    GLB --&gt; AZ2&#10;    GLB --&gt; AZ3&#10;    AZ1 --&gt; FAILOVER&#10;    AZ2 --&gt; FAILOVER&#10;    FAILOVER --&gt; BACKUP&#10;    FAILOVER --&gt; DEGRADE\">graph TB\n    subgraph 多可用区部署\n        AZ1[可用区 A]\n        AZ2[可用区 B]\n        AZ3[可用区 C]\n    end\n    subgraph 流量调度\n        DNS[DNS 智能解析]\n        GLB[全局负载均衡]\n    end\n    subgraph 容灾机制\n        FAILOVER[自动故障转移]\n        BACKUP[数据多副本]\n        DEGRADE[降级预案]\n    end\n    DNS --&gt; GLB\n    GLB --&gt; AZ1\n    GLB --&gt; AZ2\n    GLB --&gt; AZ3\n    AZ1 --&gt; FAILOVER\n    AZ2 --&gt; FAILOVER\n    FAILOVER --&gt; BACKUP\n    FAILOVER --&gt; DEGRADE</pre><p>高可用架构的核心思想是消除单点故障、实现故障自动恢复。每个层次都需要冗余设计——网络层的多线路接入、计算层的多实例部署、存储层的多副本复制。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可用性等级</th>\n<th>年停机时间</th>\n<th>月停机时间</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>关键技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>99%</td>\n<td>3.65 天</td>\n<td>7.3 小时</td>\n<td>内部管理系统</td>\n<td>单机部署 + 手动恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>99.9%</td>\n<td>8.76 小时</td>\n<td>43.8 分钟</td>\n<td>普通网站</td>\n<td>双机热备 + 自动切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>99.99%</td>\n<td>52.6 分钟</td>\n<td>4.38 分钟</td>\n<td>电商核心交易</td>\n<td>多活部署 + 自动降级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>99.999%</td>\n<td>5.26 分钟</td>\n<td>26.3 秒</td>\n<td>金融支付核心</td>\n<td>异地多活 + 实时复制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"负载均衡与流量分发\">负载均衡与流量分发</h2><p>负载均衡是高可用架构的第一道防线，将请求均匀分配到多个服务实例上，避免单点过载。电商系统通常采用四层（L4）和七层（L7）负载均衡的组合部署。</p>\n<p>四层负载均衡（如 LVS、DPVS）工作在传输层，基于 IP 和端口进行流量转发，性能极高（单机百万级 QPS），适合处理南北向流量入口。七层负载均衡（如 Nginx、Envoy）工作在应用层，能够基于 URL 路径、请求头、Cookie 等信息进行智能路由，适合实现灰度发布、A/B 测试和动态权重调整。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LoadBalanceStrategy {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  select(instances: ServiceInstance[], request?: RequestContext): ServiceInstance;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ServiceInstance {&#10;  host: string;&#10;  port: number;&#10;  weight: number;&#10;  healthy: boolean;&#10;  activeConnections: number;&#10;  avgResponseTimeMs: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const weightedRoundRobin: LoadBalanceStrategy = {&#10;  name: &#39;weighted_round_robin&#39;,&#10;  select(instances) {&#10;    const healthyInstances = instances.filter((i) =&gt; i.healthy);&#10;    const totalWeight = healthyInstances.reduce((sum, i) =&gt; sum + i.weight, 0);&#10;    let random = Math.random() * totalWeight;&#10;    for (const instance of healthyInstances) {&#10;      random -= instance.weight;&#10;      if (random &lt;= 0) return instance;&#10;    }&#10;    return healthyInstances[0];&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;const leastConnections: LoadBalanceStrategy = {&#10;  name: &#39;least_connections&#39;,&#10;  select(instances) {&#10;    const healthyInstances = instances.filter((i) =&gt; i.healthy);&#10;    return healthyInstances.reduce((min, i) =&gt; (i.activeConnections &lt; min.activeConnections ? i : min));&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoadBalanceStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">instances</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServiceInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">request</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RequestContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServiceInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServiceInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  host</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  port</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  healthy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  activeConnections</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  avgResponseTimeMs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> weightedRoundRobin</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoadBalanceStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'weighted_round_robin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">instances</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> healthyInstances</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instances.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i.healthy);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> totalWeight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> healthyInstances.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i.weight, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalWeight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> healthyInstances) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      random </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance.weight;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (random </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> healthyInstances[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> leastConnections</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoadBalanceStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'least_connections'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">instances</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> healthyInstances</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instances.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i.healthy);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> healthyInstances.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i.activeConnections </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min.activeConnections </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>健康检查是负载均衡的基础。主动健康检查定期向后端实例发送探测请求（HTTP GET 或 TCP 连接），连续失败超过阈值则摘除实例。被动健康检查通过监控实际请求的成功率和响应时间来判断实例健康状态。电商系统通常同时启用主动和被动健康检查，主动检查的间隔设为 5-10 秒，被动检查的窗口设为 30 秒内错误率超过 50% 则摘除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"cdn-加速与边缘计算\">CDN 加速与边缘计算</h2><p>CDN（Content Delivery Network）将静态资源和动态内容缓存到离用户最近的边缘节点，显著降低访问延迟。电商平台 70% 以上的请求是静态资源请求（商品图片、CSS、JS 文件），CDN 能将这些请求的响应时间从数百毫秒降低到 10-30 毫秒。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    USER[用户] --&gt; DNS{DNS 解析}&#10;    DNS --&gt;|就近| EDGE1[边缘节点 A]&#10;    DNS --&gt;|就近| EDGE2[边缘节点 B]&#10;    DNS --&gt;|回源| ORIGIN[源站]&#10;    EDGE1 --&gt;|miss| MID[中间层节点]&#10;    EDGE2 --&gt;|miss| MID&#10;    MID --&gt;|miss| ORIGIN&#10;    ORIGIN --&gt; OSS[(对象存储)]\">graph LR\n    USER[用户] --&gt; DNS{DNS 解析}\n    DNS --&gt;|就近| EDGE1[边缘节点 A]\n    DNS --&gt;|就近| EDGE2[边缘节点 B]\n    DNS --&gt;|回源| ORIGIN[源站]\n    EDGE1 --&gt;|miss| MID[中间层节点]\n    EDGE2 --&gt;|miss| MID\n    MID --&gt;|miss| ORIGIN\n    ORIGIN --&gt; OSS[(对象存储)]</pre><p>电商场景下 CDN 的使用策略需要根据内容类型区分：商品图片设置较长的缓存时间（7-30 天），通过版本化 URL 实现更新；价格和库存等动态数据不缓存或设置极短 TTL（1-5 秒）；商品详情页采用 ESI（Edge Side Includes）技术，将页面拆分为静态框架和动态片段，静态部分在 CDN 缓存，动态部分实时回源获取。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内容类型</th>\n<th>缓存策略</th>\n<th>TTL</th>\n<th>更新方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品图片</td>\n<td>CDN 强缓存</td>\n<td>7-30 天</td>\n<td>URL 版本化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JS/CSS 资源</td>\n<td>CDN 强缓存</td>\n<td>365 天</td>\n<td>文件名 Hash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>商品详情页</td>\n<td>ESI 分片缓存</td>\n<td>5-60 分钟</td>\n<td>主动清除 + TTL 兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索结果</td>\n<td>不缓存</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>实时查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价格/库存</td>\n<td>协商缓存</td>\n<td>1-5 秒</td>\n<td>ETag / Last-Modified</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户数据</td>\n<td>不缓存</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>私有数据不经 CDN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>边缘计算将部分业务逻辑推送到 CDN 节点执行（如 Cloudflare Workers、AWS Lambda@Edge），实现更低延迟的个性化处理。电商场景中，边缘节点可以执行地域化定价、A/B 测试分流、设备适配和 Bot 检测等逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自动伸缩与容量规划\">自动伸缩与容量规划</h2><p>弹性伸缩使电商系统能够根据实时负载自动调整计算资源。大促场景的流量可能是日常的 10-100 倍，手动扩容无法及时响应。自动伸缩策略通常基于 CPU 使用率、内存使用率、请求队列长度或自定义业务指标触发。</p>\n<p>水平自动伸缩（HPA）是最常用的策略：当某个服务的 CPU 使用率持续高于 70% 超过 3 分钟时，自动增加 Pod 副本数；当 CPU 使用率低于 30% 超过 10 分钟时，缩减副本。垂直自动伸缩（VPA）动态调整单个 Pod 的资源配额，适合负载模式稳定的服务。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ScalingPolicy {&#10;  serviceName: string;&#10;  minReplicas: number;&#10;  maxReplicas: number;&#10;  metrics: ScalingMetric[];&#10;  scaleUpCooldownSec: number;&#10;  scaleDownCooldownSec: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface ScalingMetric {&#10;  type: &#39;cpu&#39; | &#39;memory&#39; | &#39;rps&#39; | &#39;queue_depth&#39; | &#39;custom&#39;;&#10;  targetValue: number;&#10;  tolerancePercent: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const orderServiceScaling: ScalingPolicy = {&#10;  serviceName: &#39;order-service&#39;,&#10;  minReplicas: 3,&#10;  maxReplicas: 50,&#10;  metrics: [&#10;    { type: &#39;cpu&#39;, targetValue: 70, tolerancePercent: 10 },&#10;    { type: &#39;rps&#39;, targetValue: 1000, tolerancePercent: 15 },&#10;  ],&#10;  scaleUpCooldownSec: 60,&#10;  scaleDownCooldownSec: 300,&#10;};&#10;&#10;function calculateDesiredReplicas(&#10;  currentReplicas: number,&#10;  currentMetricValue: number,&#10;  targetMetricValue: number,&#10;): number {&#10;  const ratio = currentMetricValue / targetMetricValue;&#10;  const desired = Math.ceil(currentReplicas * ratio);&#10;  return desired;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ScalingPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  serviceName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  minReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  maxReplicas</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ScalingMetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scaleUpCooldownSec</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scaleDownCooldownSec</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ScalingMetric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cpu'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'memory'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rps'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'queue_depth'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'custom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetValue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</s