E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>大促场景的容量规划遵循「压测 → 预估 → 预扩容 → 实时伸缩」的流程。全链路压测在仿真环境中模拟大促流量，确定每个服务的性能基线和瓶颈点。基于历史数据和业务预估确定目标流量，在大促前提前扩容到预估容量的 120%。活动期间自动伸缩作为兜底策略处理流量预估偏差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"熔断降级与故障隔离\">熔断降级与故障隔离</h2><p>大促期间非核心功能的故障不应影响核心交易链路。熔断降级策略将系统功能分为核心功能和非核心功能，当系统压力超过阈值时主动关闭非核心功能，将资源集中到核心交易上。</p>\n<p>降级预案根据系统负载分为多个级别：一级降级关闭推荐和个性化功能，返回热门商品列表；二级降级关闭评价和问答功能，仅保留商品基本信息；三级降级关闭搜索，仅保留类目浏览；四级降级进入「只读模式」，仅允许已创建订单的支付操作。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DegradationConfig {&#10;  level: 1 | 2 | 3 | 4;&#10;  disabledFeatures: string[];&#10;  fallbackStrategies: Record&lt;string, () =&gt; unknown&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const degradationLevels: DegradationConfig[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    level: 1,&#10;    disabledFeatures: [&#39;recommendation&#39;, &#39;personalization&#39;, &#39;live_chat&#39;],&#10;    fallbackStrategies: {&#10;      recommendation: () =&gt; ({ type: &#39;hot_items&#39;, items: getCachedHotItems() }),&#10;      personalization: () =&gt; ({ type: &#39;default_layout&#39; }),&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    level: 2,&#10;    disabledFeatures: [&#39;reviews&#39;, &#39;qa&#39;, &#39;recommendation&#39;, &#39;personalization&#39;, &#39;live_chat&#39;],&#10;    fallbackStrategies: {&#10;      reviews: () =&gt; ({ type: &#39;cached&#39;, data: getCachedReviews() }),&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    level: 3,&#10;    disabledFeatures: [&#39;search&#39;, &#39;reviews&#39;, &#39;qa&#39;, &#39;recommendation&#39;, &#39;personalization&#39;, &#39;live_chat&#39;],&#10;    fallbackStrategies: {&#10;      search: () =&gt; ({ type: &#39;category_browse_only&#39; }),&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    level: 4,&#10;    disabledFeatures: [&#39;search&#39;, &#39;reviews&#39;, &#39;qa&#39;, &#39;recommendation&#39;, &#39;personalization&#39;, &#39;live_chat&#39;, &#39;new_orders&#39;],&#10;    fallbackStrategies: {&#10;      new_orders: () =&gt; ({ type: &#39;read_only_mode&#39;, message: &#39;当前仅支持已有订单操作&#39; }),&#10;    },&